---
const MAPS_URL = "https://maps.app.goo.gl/qKiXufxYfqKcgbWy9";
---
<section class="order-cta">
  <div class="inner container">
    <h2>Hot, fresh &amp; <em style="color:var(--gold)">ready when you call</em></h2>
    <p>Rajesh Gokuldas Jobanputra started Rajubhai Dabeliwale in Nashik back in 1987 — call ahead and your favourite Dabeli will be waiting.</p>
    <div class="order-cta-actions">
      <a href="tel:+919168169991" class="btn btn-cream">Call to Order<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-phone"/></svg></a>
      <a href={MAPS_URL} class="btn btn-line" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get Directions</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
